BugCase is built with open-source dependencies, each distributed
under its own license (for example MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC, BSD). Those
licenses are not superseded by this NOTICE; the full set of resolved
dependencies and their licenses is described by pnpm-lock.yaml and
the individual packages under node_modules. To regenerate a current
inventory, run a license-report tool against the installed
dependency tree.

